    "body": "Merged main to resolve conflicts. For `haas.cps`, `mazak.cps`, `sinumerik.cps` and `tormach.cps` I took main's version: main already gates the spindle on `sRpm > 0` there (#173, and Tormach #108/#362, which also skips the probe's coolant). This PR now carries only the **Heidenhain** gate, which main still lacks, plus its pin `probe_spindle` and the decision file.\n\nTargeted gate:\n- `probe_spindle` 6, `heidenhain_block_form` 4, `heidenhain_arc_centre` 2, `probe_op` 12, `probe_tormach` 7, `probe_dialects` 13, `conformance` 2, `tormach_post` 10: all green.\n- clippy: n/a (no Rust source changed).\n\nReady for a re-check (/resolve-conflicts check). The PR body's list of five posts is now historical, since four are already on main.",
