    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: ba53f41cda3fd56609a80437b8442364fa8b3d8e -->\nDelta review (merge of main since 822bf6ad): clean.\n\nOnly commit since the last review is the merge of main (4827fde6). Checked: `git diff upstream/main --stat` lists only the PR's own 3 files (heidenhain.cps, tests/probe_spindle.rs, the decision record), so nothing from main is dropped. The four conflicts (haas, mazak, sinumerik, tormach .cps) differ only in a comment on the haas/mazak/sinumerik `sRpm > 0` guard and, on Tormach, main's `touchProbe` handling (#108/#362); all take main's side, which already gates the probe's spindle start. The merged tree keeps the guard in all five posts (heidenhain via this PR's change). No safety check lost.\n\nTests (debug): app `probe_spindle` 13/13, `probe_dialects` 2/2, `probe_tormach` 7/7. `clippy -p camcraft-app --lib` plus the touched test target with `-D warnings`: clean.\n",
